leType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3354823818,"text":"遅かったじゃない、ずっと待ってたのよ！","nextNodeIds":[736520102]},{"nodeId":736520102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2998252234,"text":"それじゃ、「リメルトタブレット」の効果について詳しく話してくれる？","nextNodeIds":[736520103]},{"nodeId":736520103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":425613922,"text":"ハジャナド、興奮してるみたいだね。","nextNodeIds":[736520104]},{"nodeId":736520104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":951549602,"text":"じゃあ、まずは短所から言うぞ。覚悟しろ！","nextNodeIds":[736520105]},{"nodeId":736520105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2748443922,"text":"「リメルトタブレット」の短所と長所について、ハジャナドに詳しく説明した。","nextNodeIds":[736520106]},{"nodeId":736520106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2867531218,"text":"なるほど…わかったわ。","nextNodeIds":[736520107]},{"nodeId":736520107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":278120330,"text":"今の爆発だと薬の混ぜ具合を正確にコントロールできないから、効果が安定しないのね。","nextNodeIds":[736520108]},{"nodeId":736520108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2028021738,"text":"小型爆弾にカバーを取り付け、衝撃波を収束して、タブレットをプリセットする際の配列を最適化する…","nextNodeIds":[736520109]},{"nodeId":736520109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":591841906,"text":"うん、改良に時間は掛からなそう。問題は資金ね…","nextNodeIds":[736520110]},{"nodeId":736520110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2273919754,"text":"いざという時のために予算を残しておいてよかった。これから一日一食にして、古い機材を売り払えば足りるはず。","nextNodeIds":[736520111]},{"nodeId":736520111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2591380850,"text":"一日一食しか食べないのか？","nextNodeIds":[736520112]},{"nodeId":736520112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2721595570,"text":"いやいや、そんなの絶対に耐えられないぞ！資金が足りないなら、なんでもっと早く言わなかったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[736520113]},{"nodeId":736520113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":602837618,"text":"ああ、安心して、報酬はきっちり支払うから。それは予算の中から一番に確保してあるわ。","nextNodeIds":[736520114]},{"nodeId":736520114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":1394456354,"text":"以前は一日一食が当たり前だったの。週に三食しか食べない時期もあったから、もう慣れっこよ。大丈夫。","nextNodeIds":[736520115]},{"nodeId":736520115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1205098218,"text":"なにもそこまで頑張らなくても…","nextNodeIds":[736520116]},{"nodeId":736520116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3408920042,"text":"すっごく気になるから、はっきり答えてほしいんだけど——","nextNodeIds":[736520117]},{"nodeId":736520117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1863057554,"text":"ハジャナドさんは、どうしてそこまでして有名な学者になりたいんだ？","nextNodeIds":[736520118]},{"nodeId":736520118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":387802642,"text":"研究が好きだから？自分の才能を証明したいから？それとも錬金術でモラをいっぱい稼ぎたいからか？","nextNodeIds":[736520119]},{"nodeId":736520119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3820723234,"text":"えっと…","nextNodeIds":[736520120]},{"nodeId":736520120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2129813738,"text":"そんなこと急に聞かれても、なんて答えたらいいか…もしかしたら、昔いじめられてたのが悔しかったからかも。","nextNodeIds":[736520121]},{"nodeId":736520121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3027111346,"text":"それに自分の能力を証明できれば、生活も楽になるしね。","nextNodeIds":[736520122]},{"nodeId":736520122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2665350818,"text":"そんな理由で…","nextNodeIds":[736520123]},{"nodeId":736520123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3392239994,"text":"研究を始めたの？","nextNodeIds":[736520124]},{"nodeId":736520124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3907927690,"text":"そうよ。知識がすべてのこの国では、学術的な才能があれば成り上がれるもの。","nextNodeIds":[736520125]},{"nodeId":736520125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3817666706,"text":"私に天性の才能はないし、知能指数だって至って普通。だからマイナーな研究をして、全力で成果を上げるしかないの。","nextNodeIds":[736520126]},{"nodeId":736520126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":1288693346,"text":"一人で研究に没頭していると、人との付き合い方がわからなくなって、変人っぽくなってしまって…","nextNodeIds":[736520127,736520128]},{"nodeId":736520127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3121392394,"text":"世の中いい人のほうが圧倒的に多い。","nextNodeIds":[736520129]},{"nodeId":736520129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":53151210,"text":"そうだぞ。今はすごい目標があるんだから、もっとドーンと構えていればいいんだ！","nextNodeIds":[736520130]},{"nodeId":736520130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3141892106,"text":"平常心で落ち着いて話し合えば、研究に協力してくれる人は大勢いるはずだ！","nextNodeIds":[736520131]},{"nodeId":736520131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2257963274,"text":"ありがとう。ただ、それは私もわかってるの。","nextNodeIds":[736520132]},{"nodeId":736520132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3193932826,"text":"気づいたのよ。錬金術の研究は最高に面白くて、世間とか生活とか、そんなことを考えるよりずっと楽だって。","nextNodeIds":[736520133]},{"nodeId":736520133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3078611626,"text":"あなたたちに出会ってから、私も自分を見つめ直したの。確かに私は、もう少し自分の心を整えるべきね。","nextNodeIds":[736520134]},{"nodeId":736520134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":842167906,"text":"とにかく、「リメルトタブレット」の実験に協力してくれて、ありがとう。そろそろ町に戻って論文を書かなきゃ。","nextNodeIds":[736520135]},{"nodeId":736520135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":4064751090,"text":"約束の報酬よ。それと…これもあげるわ。","nextNodeIds":[736520136]},{"nodeId":736520136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1807607058,"text":"これは？","nextNodeIds":[736520137]},{"nodeId":736520137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3514801082,"text":"一番お気に入りの錬金釜。必死で貯金して買ったんだけど、もったいなくて結局ずっと使えなかったの。","nextNodeIds":[736520138]},{"nodeId":736520138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1120933450,"text":"おい！そんな大事なもの、なんで急に手放そうと思ったんだ？","nextNodeIds":[736520139]},{"nodeId":736520139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2792131754,"text":"「リメルトタブレット」は従来の薬と違って、新しく設計した機材で作る必要があるの。だから、その錬金釜は使えないのよ。","nextNodeIds":[736520140]},{"nodeId":736520140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3150387330,"text":"それに、報酬の中には約束も含まれてるでしょう？この錬金釜は、実験に立ち会ってくれたお礼よ。","nextNodeIds":[736520141]},{"nodeId":736520141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":3961400586,"text":"よかったら使って…お茶とかスープを作るのはどうかしら？抽出を促進する機能が付いてるから、美味しいスープができるはずよ！","nextNodeIds":[736520142]},{"nodeId":736520142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1681587722,"text":"そこまで言われたら…断るのも悪いよな。","nextNodeIds":[736520143]},{"nodeId":736520143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3314624610,"text":"頑張ってね、ハジャナド。","nextNodeIds":[736520144]},{"nodeId":736520144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,"speakerName":"ハジャナド","textMapHash":2800807994,"text":"もちろん！いい知らせを待っててね！","nextNodeIds":[736520145]},{"nodeId":736520145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":3467802458,"text":"ハジャナドは立ち去った。","nextNodeIds":[736520146]},{"nodeId":736520146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1052119570,"text":"#なあ、{NICKNAME}…","nextNodeIds":[736520147]},{"nodeId":736520147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":93951066,"text":"オイラたち、いいことをしたんだよな？","nextNodeIds":[736520148,736520149]},{"nodeId":736520148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4045534754,"text":"普段の冒険と同じ。","nextNodeIds":[736520150]},{"nodeId":736520150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2431358098,"text":"おう、今は慌てて結論を出さなくてもいいと思うぞ。","nextNodeIds":[736520151]},{"nodeId":736520151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":612115458,"text":"オイラたちが忘れた頃に、学者になったハジャナドから急に招待状が届くかもしれないな…","nextNodeIds":[736520152]},{"nodeId":736520152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2527730082,"text":"まあ、無駄話はこのくらいにして、そろそろ行こうぜ。この錬金釜でお茶を淹れてみよう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736520149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1426205066,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}たちも平常心を保たないとね。","nextNodeIds":[736520150]},{"nodeId":736520128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":838060410,"text":"過去に囚われる必要はない。","nextNodeIds":[736520129]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7365201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30226"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7365201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30226,